<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">Error := subs(convert(derivative, list), convert(series(subs(convert(k_def, list)$M, Subs, (lhs-rhs)(evolve)), h, M+1), `+`)); #Subsitute Subs into evolve, then expand in h and use the Differential equation to subsitute y'(x)=f(x,y(x)), and convert the series into a sum.
